      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "I see mithro has been adding 1x1_max_all \uD83E\uDD14 will the pcb templates be updates for the new slot sizes? also, is it possible for another KGD to be assembled , like an external psram at time of assembly, if a wire bond plan is invluded?",
