    {
      "id": "1533470044846297149",
      "type": "Reply",
      "timestamp": "2026-08-02T13:42:29.187+00:00",
      "timestampEdited": "2026-08-02T13:44:26.142+00:00",
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "Sorry, I don't know what you mean by `1x1_max_all` but I don't think we'll be doing any kinds of multi die packaging for a while if that's what you're referring to. \n\nMouser and others stock PSRAM you can add to your motherboard \nhttps://www.mouser.com/en/ProductDetail/878-APS6404L-3SQR-SN\n\n*edit*: \n> will the pcb templates be updates for the new slot sizes?\nYes, all standard slot sizes will have COB available, you do not need to do custom bonding diagrams, just use the default pad structure (VSS, VDD are the only ones that need to be the same)",
      "author": {
        "id": "756011607603019777",
        "name": "anfroholic",
        "discriminator": "0000",
        "nickname": "Andrew Wingate",
        "color": null,
